<h1>Maria Hadden</h1>
<p>49th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.mariafor49.org/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (mariafor49.org)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions for reelection on Oct. 19, 2026. Her campaign site has not been updated since 2022; its priorities then were development without displacement, a safe and healthy community, environmental justice, public schools, a strong local economy, and community voice and transparency.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>49th Ward alderwoman since 2019; founding board member of the Participatory Budgeting Project and former executive director of Our City Our Voice.</p>
